# Hand-written changes over the generated catalog. The catalog is never edited by hand: its
# header hash would refuse the build. Each change names its target, so regenerating the
# catalog keeps them, and a target that disappears is an error here.
use catalog

# The first song is the tutorial: its hard clear needs no lens.
replace check amber_drift.amber_drift_hard_clear: true

# A chart the export lists that the game never shipped.
remove check velvet_echo.velvet_echo_hard_perfect

# A song cut from the release: its region and the way to it go.
remove exit song_select.jade_lantern
remove region jade_lantern

# A song that also opens with the neon pack.
replace exit song_select.cobalt_signal: has_any(orbit_pack, neon_pack) and count(tier_pass) >= 2

# The jukebox in the song select screen.
extend region song_select {
  check jukebox_secret: has(metronome) and count(tier_pass) >= 1
}
